      content="sqlite_schema_forge quick-start guide: declare the schema, migrate with auto-diffing, plan and control migrations, keys, FTS, and triggers."
    />
    <title>sqlite_schema_forge quick start: The Forge Ecosystem</title>
    <style is:global>
      :root {
        --paper: #fbfaf6;
        --paper-deep: #f3efe4;
        --ink: #16202c;
        --ink-soft: #43536a;
        --rule: #e0d9c6;
        --board: #141c28;
